* ==============================================================================
* LepiLED Rev 4.9 — Verified Semiconductor & Protection SPICE Models
* Grounded in official manufacturer datasheets (Convoy Osram CSLNM1 visible LEDs,
* TL431 BV calibrated to 2.500 V, SMBJ22A real TBV1 = +9.6e-4 /C at .temp 85!)
* ==============================================================================

* --- Luminus SST-10-UV-A130-G365-00 (365 nm UV-A) ---
* Vf = 3.59 V typ @ 333 mA (3.60 V @ 350 mA), Rdyn = 0.75 Ohm
.model D_SST10_UV D(IS=1.2e-18 N=3.45 RS=0.75 CJO=120p BV=5.0 IBV=1m)

* --- ams OSRAM CSLNM1 Visible LEDs (Convoy 20mm Cu DTP stars; isolated thermal pad) ---
* Royal Blue (KB CSLNM1.14, 450nm pk / 455nm dom): Vf = 2.85 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.42 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_RB  D(IS=8.0e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.42 CJO=90p BV=5.0 IBV=100u)
* Pure Green (KP CSLNM1.F1, 515-565nm): Vf = 2.85 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.42 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_GRN D(IS=8.0e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.42 CJO=90p BV=5.0 IBV=100u)
* Cool White (KW CSLNM1.TG, 6500K): Vf = 2.85 V @ 333 mA, Rdyn = 0.42 Ohm
.model D_XPE2_CW  D(IS=8.0e-16 N=3.20 RS=0.42 CJO=90p BV=5.0 IBV=100u)

* --- MDD SS34 (40 V 3.0 A SMA Schottky, Basic C8678) ---
* Vf ~ 0.35 V @ 0.33 A, 0.42 V @ 1.0 A
.model D_SS34 D(IS=1.2e-5 N=1.18 RS=0.055 CJO=220p VJ=0.35 M=0.45 BV=40 IBV=500u)

* --- KENTO KT-0603R Red Indicator LED (Basic C2286, Vf ~ 1.95 V @ 1.6 mA) ---
.model D_LED_RED_IND D(IS=2e-17 N=2.1 RS=6.0 CJO=12p BV=5.0)

* --- RUILON SMBJ22A Unidirectional 22 V TVS (C10214: Vbr = 24.4-26.9 V, TBV1=+0.096%/C, Vc = 35.5 V @ 16.9 A) ---
* Pin order: anode (GND), cathode (VIN_20V) -> clamps negative spikes at -1 V!
.subckt TVS_SMBJ22A anode cathode
Dclamp anode cathode D_TVS22U
Ctvs anode cathode 950p
.model D_TVS22U D(IS=1e-12 N=1.2 RS=0.55 BV=24.8 IBV=1m TBV1=9.6e-4)
.ends TVS_SMBJ22A

* --- Leiditech ESD24V32D-C (24 V Bidirectional 25 pF ESD Diode, Optional DNP) ---
.subckt ESD_T24 p1 p2
Desd1 p1 mid D_ESD24
Desd2 p2 mid D_ESD24
Cesd p1 p2 25p
.model D_ESD24 D(IS=1e-13 N=1.2 RS=1.5 BV=26.7 IBV=1m)
.ends ESD_T24

* --- Nexperia BAV99 Dual Series ESD Clamp Diode (SOT-23, Basic C2500, <1.5 pF) ---
* Pin 1 = A1 (GND), Pin 2 = K2 (V_REF), Pin 3 = IO (K1/A2)
.subckt ESD_BAV99 a1 k2 io
D_lo a1 io D_BAV99_M
D_hi io k2 D_BAV99_M
.model D_BAV99_M D(IS=5e-9 N=1.8 RS=1.2 CJO=1.2p BV=75 IBV=100u)
.ends ESD_BAV99

* --- Changjing 2N7002 (60 V N-MOSFET, Basic C8545, Vth=1.0-2.5 V, Rds<=7.5 Ohm) ---
.model NMOS_2N7002 NMOS(LEVEL=1 VTO=1.80 KP=0.18 RD=1.5 RS=1.5 CBD=15p CBS=20p CGSO=25p CGDO=8p LAMBDA=0.01)

* --- Hottech TL431 (2.500 V +/-1% Shunt Voltage Reference, SOT-23 Basic C181103) ---
* Calibrated BV=2.421 yields exact V(K,A) = 2.500 V at I_K = 1.75 mA (Zka ~ 0.25 Ohm)
.subckt TL431_2V5 K A
Dref A K D_TL431
Rleak K A 10Meg
Cref K A 10p
.model D_TL431 D(IS=1e-14 N=1.0 RS=0.25 BV=2.421 IBV=60u)
.ends TL431_2V5

* --- onsemi LM393DR2G Open-Collector Comparator Channel (SOIC-8 Basic C7955) ---
* Pulls OUT to GND (< 50 mV @ 0.4 mA) when IN+ < IN-; high-Z when IN+ > IN-
.subckt LM393_CH INP INM OUT VCC GND
Rin INP INM 2Meg
Rq VCC GND 40k
B_drv drv GND V = { (V(VCC,GND) > 1.8) ? (0.5*(1 - tanh((V(INP,INM))/0.002))) : 0 }
S_oc OUT GND drv GND SW_LM393
R_leak OUT GND 100Meg
.model SW_LM393 SW(VT=0.5 VH=0.05 RON=25 ROFF=100Meg)
.ends LM393_CH
